{"speciesId":578,"names":{"fr":"Méios","es":"Duosion","en":"Duosion","ja":"ダブラン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il possède deux cerveaux séparés qui le font parfois agir de façon totalement incohérente."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Since they have two divided brains, at times they suddenly try to take two different actions at once."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il dégage sa puissance maximale quand ses cerveaux réfléchissent à la même chose."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When their brains, now divided in two, are thinking the same thoughts, these Pokémon exhibit their maximum power."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When their two divided brains think the same thoughts, their psychic power is maximized."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When their two divided brains think the same thoughts, their psychic power is maximized."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il possède deux cerveaux séparés qui le font parfois agir de façon totalement incohérente."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Dado que su cerebro está dividido en dos, a veces tiene conflictos a la hora de decidir qué hacer."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Since they have two divided brains, at times they suddenly try to take two different actions at once."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"２つに 分裂した 脳みそを 持っているため いきなり 違う 行動を とることが あるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il dégage le maximum de sa puissance psychique quand ses deux cerveaux réfléchissent à la même chose."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando las dos partes de su cerebro piensan lo mismo, saca todo su poder a relucir."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When their two divided brains think the same thoughts, their psychic power is maximized."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"分裂した ２つの 脳みそで 同じことを 考えると だせる サイコパワーは 最高と なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il possède deux cerveaux séparés qui le font parfois agir de façon totalement incohérente."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dado que su cerebro está dividido en dos, a veces tiene conflictos a la hora de decidir qué hacer."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Since they have two divided brains, at times they suddenly try to take two different actions at once."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"２つに 分裂した 脳みそを 持っているため いきなり 違う 行動を とることが あるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il dégage le maximum de sa puissance psychique quand ses deux cerveaux réfléchissent à la même chose."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando las dos partes de su cerebro piensan lo mismo, saca todo su poder a relucir."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When their two divided brains think the same thoughts, their psychic power is maximized."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"分裂した ２つの 脳みそで 同じことを 考えると だせる サイコパワーは 最高と なる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On prétend que lorsque ses deux cerveaux agissent à l’unisson, la portée de sa force mentale peut s’étendre sur un rayon d’un kilomètre."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Dicen que, cuando las dos partes de su cerebro piensan lo mismo, el alcance de su telequinesia aumenta hasta abarcar un radio de 1 km."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its psychic power can supposedly cover a range of more than half a mile—but only if its two brains can agree with each other."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"２つの 脳みその 意見が 一致したときの 念力は 周囲１キロに およぶと いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Étant donné que ses deux cerveaux sont rarement sur la même longueur d’onde, il est impossible de prédire son comportement."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Las dos partes de su cerebro casi nunca piensan lo mismo, por lo que es imposible predecir sus intenciones."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Its brain has 